{"id":"vod_sn_38589","vodId":"38589","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"竖笛与双肩背包第一季","name_cn":"竖笛与双肩背包第一季","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/d495408006b2ccb5e4a1b5aac5ecf03e.jpg"},"summary":"宫川敦志（置鲇龙太郎 配音）和宫川敦美（钉宫理惠 配音）是情同手足的兄妹，两人之间的感情十分深厚。敦志只是一个小学五年级的学生，却拥有着一米八零的大高个，看起来十分稳健成熟。而敦美已经升入了高中二年级，却是个身高只有一米三七的萌妹子。　　走在外面，敦志和敦美常常会被误认为是兄妹，两人的身高和样貌亦常常闹出不少的笑话，实际上，是娇小的敦美一直在保护和照顾的敦志。将敦志误以为是高中生而暗恋着他的沙夜（平野绫 配音），天真单纯的班主任盛山二见（田宫智惠 配音）、敦志暗恋着的同班同学小雏（内田彩 配音），是这些朋友们围绕在敦志和敦美的周围，在他们最需要帮助的时候伸出援手。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:02:54","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/WdTnxxa9CV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/AMrS4BBZFu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FnhKGNEuX21/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/NTf3bD0Ru71/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fgi7hY3Ntz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/q9Q16UtkSm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uqAuUCgEih1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/yME33pNAM91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TLdMjYHiuY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1eymChThw91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/CqY739H0Zc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/wwqQ5baGEN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hbHQ2cpehH1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:57.101Z"}